# Gate step 1443-uit6 — data, not code (order 1072-b7eq).
#
# WHAT IT GUARDS. The enclave git mirror enforces the project's seeded branch
# discipline (.tillandsias/branch-discipline.yaml) at pre-receive, before the
# relay, and publishes it as exactly one
# refs/tillandsias/discipline/<level>/<enforcement>/<derived>/<digest>/<epoch>.
# 1443-z3vb's land tool compares that full 64-hex digest with the checkout's
# seed, so the ref shape is an interface. Hermetic: a scratch bare mirror with
# a stub relay; nothing touches this checkout or GitHub. Needs ruby, which the
# mirror image ships; it skips by name without it.
#
# STEP_LUA is a LITERAL path on purpose (1063-nraf).
STEP_DESC="Checking the git mirror enforces and publishes the seeded branch discipline (1443-uit6)"
STEP_LUA="scripts/lua/test-mirror-discipline.lua"
STEP_ERROR="the git mirror no longer enforces or publishes the seeded branch discipline as specified (1443-uit6); see which arm failed above"
STEP_OK="mirror enforces the seeded discipline and publishes one discipline ref"
STEP_SECOND_REGIME="macbookair 2026-11-25 darwin ok:mirror-discipline:22 arms"
